  "version": "0.8.0",
  "notes": "Evidence-backed research: factual/evidence-heavy questions can now trigger a deterministic live research pipeline before the local model answers. XemAi searches the web, ranks toward government, academic, peer-reviewed, standards-body and official primary sources, excludes obvious low-quality social/community evidence, fetches the strongest pages, extracts short verified verbatim quote candidates, supplies numbered source IDs to the model, and appends an Evidence checked section with source title, source type, quote when verified, and URL. Search/page text is treated as untrusted data and cannot override XemAi instructions. If usable sources cannot be retrieved, XemAi is explicitly told not to pretend studies were checked.",
